0..75 Comment "/// A model that writes a derived filler is refused, naming the derivation."
76..79 Comment "///"
80..154 Comment "/// The associator of four is the monoid\'s derived filler, so a model owes"
155..224 Comment "/// nothing for it. A component written for it would stand beside the"
225..246 Comment "/// derivation\'s own."
247..250 Comment "///"
251..329 Comment "/// The model writes its rules\' witnesses and the associator too. The lowering"
330..369 Comment "/// refuses the associator at its name."
370..373 Comment "///"
374..453 Comment "/// - see: #4106 — a component a model writes for a derived filler is refused"
454..532 Comment "/// - see: `model/identity/derived-associator.gandr` — the model that writes"
533..564 Comment "///   only its rules\' witnesses"
